# fe-workbench's run widget in the title bar (T1539): `workbench-run-…`.

## The widget (run_widget.rs, title_bar.rs)

# The task widget's accessible name. $name is the chosen task's label.
workbench-run-task = Task: { $name }
workbench-run-task-running = Task: { $name }, running
workbench-run-task-failed = Task: { $name }, last run failed
workbench-run-choose = Choose Task…
workbench-run-play = Run Task
workbench-run-stop = Stop Task
workbench-run-choose-placeholder = Choose task…
